Modifications in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Added a Samsung Galaxy A53 5G (SM-A536E) target for firmware A536EXXSMGZE2,
  kernel 5.10.237-android12-9-31999025-abA536EXXSMGZE2.
- Added a build-time address-layout switch, GHOSTLOCK_TARGET_A53_5_10, selecting
  the CONFIG_ARM64_VA_BITS=39 layout (_text = 0xffffffc008000000,
  PAGE_OFFSET = 0xffffffc000000000) instead of the default VA_BITS=48 GKI
  layout. The default layout is unchanged when the flag is not defined.
- Added kernel_profiles/5.10-template.conf and the A536EXXSMGZE2 profile,
  registered in kernel_profiles/index.conf.
- Fixed a silent failure mode where profile address resolution threw without
  logging, and a PAGE_SIZE redefinition collision with newer NDK libc headers.

